BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto SUP, Kayak & Canoe
UID:event_314804930@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260604T044602Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260604T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260604T180000
SUMMARY:Kayak\, Canoe\, Stand-up Paddling Board on the scenic Humber River
 !
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\n**Explo
 re the scenic Humber River in Toronto with our Kayak\, Canoe\, and stand-u
 p paddle board 2-hour rentals during the week!** Use the following link to
  book your spot:[ ](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-cano
 e-sup-rentals/)**[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-
 sup-rentals/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup-
 rentals/)**[ ](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup
 -rentals/)\n\nThe calm meandering Humber River is one of Toronto’s hidde
 n gems! Home to a huge variety of wildlife\, including Beaver\, Blue Heron
 \, Deer and much more\, you’ll feel like you’ve left the city behind!\
 n\n*Events are subject to weather and other factors out of our control. If
  we must cancel or delay an event we will those booked on the [torontoadve
 ntures.ca](http://torontoadventures.ca/) website know as soon as possible.
 *\n\n**Weekday Pricing (per 2-hour rental)\, Payable online through:** [ht
 tps://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup-rentals/](https:
 //torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup-rentals/)\nSingle Ka
 yak (seats 1 person) : $44.95+taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $79.9
 5+taxes\nRegular Canoe (seats 2 people) : $69.95+taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats
  3 people) : $79.95+taxes\nStand-up Paddle Board ( 1 person): $44.95+taxes
 \n\n**Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\, Paddle(s)\, PFD(s)/ “Life Jacket(s)”\
 , & Coast Guard Safety Kit.\n* Brief orientation covering paddling safety\
 , Toronto Adventures’ rules\, and the Humber River paddling route\n* Our
  friendly staff to help you launch your boat(s) and/or boards.\n* SUP Leas
 h (For Paddle Board Rentals Only)\n\n**What to bring?**\n\n* Dress for the
  weather!\n* Wear closed-toe athletic footwear you don’t mind getting we
 t & muddy (shoes not required on SUPs).\n* Sunscreen\, sunglasses & hats\,
  are all recommended for sunny days.\n* A water bottle.\n* Government Issu
 ed Photo ID.\n\n**Important Information**\nAnyone under the age of 18 must
  have a Parent/Guardian/Adult accompany them all the times on the water. O
 nline Adult Waivers are available through confirmation emails. For minors\
 , waivers will need to be signed in person on location. There must be an A
 dult to Child ratio of 1:4 in the children are under 12 years of age. From
  ages 12-18 we require a 1:5 adult to youth ratio. We have lifejackets sta
 rting at 30 pounds and are fully adjustable.\n\n* Paddlers must be comfort
 able treading water while wearing a PFD and reaching a shoreline (minimum 
 20 metres to shore).\n* Late Fees Returning Boat(s)/Equipment – $20/15 m
 inutes per boat.\n\n**[Google Link Directions](https://torontoadventures.c
 a/directions/#humberriverlocation)**\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://toro
 ntoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)**\n\nWe hope to see you out on the wat
 er!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontoadventurers/events/314804930/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260515T173441Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260515T173441Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
