BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto SUP, Kayak & Canoe
UID:event_314296540@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260604T044602Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260611T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260611T220000
SUMMARY:A Guided Glow in the Dark Paddle! 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\nJoin ou
 r guided\, Glow-In-The-Dark Paddle on June 11! Use the following link to b
 ook your spot on our Voyageur Canoe: [https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adv
 entures/glow-in-the-dark-guided-tour/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-ad
 ventures/glow-in-the-dark-guided-tour/)\n\nGlide through the shimmering wa
 ters of the Humber River in our illuminated Voyageur Canoe. The 11-seater 
 canoe is setup with SUBMRG’s Under Glow Lighting System\, which casts a 
 halo of light all around the boat as the group paddles. Our experienced gu
 ides will take you on a 1.5-hour tour of some of the coolest spots on the 
 Humber!\n\n*Events are subject to weather and other factors out of our con
 trol. If we must cancel or delay an event we will let those booked on the 
 torontoadventures.ca website know as soon as possible.*\n\n**Pricing (per 
 seat)\, Payable online through:**[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventu
 res/glow-in-the-dark-guided-tour/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-advent
 ures/glow-in-the-dark-guided-tour/)\n\n* Voyageur Canoe: $45+tax (per seat
 )\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Seat on the Voyageur Canoe\n* Paddle\n* PFD
 (s) “Lifejackets”\n* SUBMRG Under Glow Lighting\n* 1.5-Hour Guided Nig
 ht Paddle of Toronto’s Humber River!\n* Our experienced staff to help yo
 u every step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n\n* Dress for the weather!
 \n* Wear closed-toe athletic footwear you don’t mind getting wet & muddy
 .\n* It gets cooler at night so bring an extra layer.\n* Government Issued
  Photo ID.\n\n**More Information:**\n\n* We Start & Finish this event at o
 ur Humber Location\, so no need for a shuttle.\n* Please plan to arrive at
  least 15 minutes early for Check-In to ensure the entire group can begin 
 and embark on the tour on time.\n* Waivers to be signed on location.\n* Pa
 ddlers must be comfortable treading water while wearing a PFD and reaching
  a shoreline (minimum 20 metres to shore)\n\n**[Google Link Directions](ht
 tps://www.google.ca/maps/dir//Toronto+Adventures:+Humber+River+Paddling+Ce
 ntre\,+9+Old+Mill+Rd\,+Etobicoke\,+ON+M8X+0A5/@43.6493249\,-79.4923631\,15
 z/data=!4m9!4m8!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x882b36600580f343:0x299b832aaa564814!2m2!1d
 -79.4923631!2d43.6493249!3e0)**\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://torontoad
 ventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)**\n\nWe hope to see you out on the water!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontoadventurers/events/314296540/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260415T144457Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260415T144457Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
