UID:event_314296443@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260604T044602Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260612T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260612T193000
SUMMARY:Music on the River (ft. Dan Dwoskin) - A Paddle-In Concert! 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\nThis Mu
 sic on the River show (June 12th) features the musical stylings of Dan Dwo
 skin! To book your spot\, please go to the link:\n*[https://torontoadventu
 res.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/](https://torontoadventures
 .ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/)*\nLink shows live boat avail
 ability and options!\n\nLocated on Toronto’s beautiful Humber River our 
 Music On The River event starts at our Humber Paddling centre which is onl
 y a 5-Minute walk from Old Mill TTC Station! Upon arrival we’ll get you 
 signed in and set you up with your boat and equipment before you embark on
  your scenic paddle of the meandering Humber River before enjoying a 45-Mi
 nute set from Popular Local Toronto Artists!\n\n*Events are subject to wea
 ther and other factors out of our control. If we must cancel or delay an e
 vent we will let those booked on the torontoadventures.ca website know as 
 soon as possible.*\n\n**Booking and Pricing:**\n[https://torontoadventures
 .ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca
 /all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/)\nSingle Kayak (seats 1 person) 
 : $40 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $80 +taxes\nRegular Canoe (s
 eats 2 people) : $70 +taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats 3 people) : $90 +taxes\nSt
 and Up Paddleboard (1 person) : $45 +taxes\nBring Your Own Boat (boat/equi
 pment): $10 +taxes.\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Paddle(s)\n* P
 FD(s) “Lifejackets”\n* A concert right on the river!\n* Our experience
 d staff to help you every step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n\n* Dres
 s for the weather!\n* Wear closed-toe athletic footwear you don't mind get
 ting wet and muddy.\n* Sunscreen\, Sunglasses & Hats\, are all recommended
  for sunny days!\n* Blanket to keep you cozy during the show\n\n**[Google 
 Link Directions](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humberriverlocat
 ion)**\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancella
 tion)**[ ](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)\n\nWe hope to s
 ee you out on the water!
